@crew v-saarinen-teo
// Writer 2, batch 8: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh. Hello. Teo. Astronomy. Mind the lens. It's very big.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hi, {me}. I named a star. After a café. Please don't laugh.
?

== chat
- The lens is the size of a dinner plate. I carried it on my knees the whole way.   #funny
- I call home every night. They ask if I've talked to anyone. Now I can say yes.   #warm

== near
? habit:window-seat
- Window seat. I'm counting the ones I haven't named yet.
? deck:2 time:night
- Observatory. Quiet. Lens fitted. Perfect.
?

== bye
- Bye, then. Um. Thanks for talking.

== smalltalk
- Mind the lens.
- That one's a café now.   #funny
